      <rules>
        <rule name="Death Mask of Sanguinius" id="ffb9-0aa9-7816-15af" hidden="false">
          <description>Any enemy unit that loses as close combat against a model wearing a Death Mask suffers -1 modifier to its Leadership test.
Any enemy squad with a model within 6&quot; of Dante at the start of that side&apos;s turn must pass a Morale check or immediately start falling back. The -1 modifier for being below half strength applies.</description>
